 "description": "<p>Topographic and climatic data for watersheds (stream order 4) and glaciers (from RGI) in the Upper Indus Basin and surroundings. Also includes hierarchical clustering results presented in the publication:</p>\n\n<p><em>T. Smith, A. Rheinwalt, B. Bookhagen, Topography and Climate in the Upper Indus Basin: Mapping Elevation-Snow Cover Relationships, Science of The Total Environment, 2021, 147363, ISSN 0048-9697, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.scitotenv.2021.147363.</em></p>\n\n<p>Snow-water equivalent data from:</p>\n\n<p><em>T Smith and B. Bookhagen. &ldquo;Assessing Multi-Temporal Snow-Volume Trends in High Mountain Asia From 1987 to 2016 Using High-Resolution Passive Microwave Data.&rdquo; Front. Earth Sci. (2020) 8:559175. https://doi.org/10.3389/feart.2020.559175</em></p>",
